        },
        {
          "text": " Kigirunai eikor kokudo kari nakoto ari naka eŋalakimak ageun koronat loejai kinaren ka Bet-koron kari naka eŋalakimak; kosan Kiriat-baal (nopenol ŋes Kiriatyearim), ere loka idwe luka Yuda: ŋol ŋes ewai lokoto. ",
          "type": "text",
