        {
          "text": " Kijesar eikor atutubet naesanit eronat loejai kinaren kaditot naka okoku loka Kinom, loejai aditot naka Repaim kari naka agolitomei; kijesar kiton aditot naka Kinom, kiton osicp loka ari naka eŋalakimak loka Eyebusit, kobe En-rogel; ",
